{%- comment -%} Styles live in assets/ha-sections.css, loaded once in layout/theme.liquid. {%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Hartwick Atelier — THE REGISTER PAGE 01 / THE OPENING.
  Aloha's FinalHartwick_The_Register artboard, 24 September 2026.

  Her photograph of an open glassine envelope, the Atelier's own papers in
  it ("These are actual dye and paper we use at Hartwick. So it's only
  wise we turn them into simple invitations."): the petal sheet reads
  The Dispatch / Read., the folded dyed sheet The Circle / By invitation.,
  and the envelope's front carries the page's title, THE REGISTER, in the
  band's colour. The words are live text laid on the photograph at her
  positions and tilted with each sheet, so they can be edited here; each
  sheet may link down the page (the template points them at Join The
  Register and The Circle). "Hartwick Atelier / Correspondence" runs up
  the envelope's right-hand side.

  The band: Angela, 24 September — keep the purple (#502F37, Theme settings
  > Correspondence band) rather than the artboard's brown, with the grain.
  Later the same day ("Hartwick_The_Register [Recovered]"): the band is her
  wine paper photograph (`paper`), running up under a transparent menu
  (header "Transparent on these pages"); the words moved up their sheets,
  "Read." / "By invitation." in Junicode Cond Italic, THE REGISTER in
  Junicode Cond Medium, the side line in Chalk Blue.

  Every position and size is a percentage of the photograph, measured off
  the artboard (the envelope 590 wide on 1440), so the words stay on their
  sheets at any width. The type holds the site's role sizes until the
  photograph is too small for them, then shrinks with it.
  1 October 2026 (Aloha, "the updated register page"): a new photograph —
  a mauve glassine envelope holding a grey card at the back (The Circle /
  By Invitation, in Chalk Blue) and a yellow card in front (The Dispatch /
  Read, in ink). The words are upright Junicode now, not the Cond italic,
  and the envelope's front carries no title: the page's h1 stays for screen
  readers (`show_title` puts it back on the envelope). The sheets are named
  by place — left (the back sheet) and right (the front sheet) — so the
  next photograph does not need new class names.

  Terminology (CLAUDE.md): The Circle is by invitation and the sheet says
  exactly that; nothing here offers a route in.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign left_url = section.settings.left_link
  assign right_url = section.settings.right_link
-%}

<section class="ha-home ha-reg ha-reg-page ha-reg-hero{% if section.settings.grain %} ha-grain-block{% endif %}{% if section.settings.paper %} ha-reg-hero--paper{% endif %}"{% if section.settings.paper %} style="--ha-reg-paper: url({{ section.settings.paper | image_url: width: 2400 }});"{% endif %} aria-labelledby="ha-reg-hero-title">
  <div class="ha-wrap">
    {%- render 'ha-placeholder-note', show: section.settings.show_placeholder_note, text: "Placeholder — copy transcribed from Aloha's Register artboard, for her to confirm." -%}

    <div class="ha-reg-letter">
      <div class="ha-reg-letter__photo">
        {%- if section.settings.image -%}
          {{-
            section.settings.image
            | image_url: width: 1600
            | image_tag: class: 'ha-reg-letter__img', loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high', sizes: '(min-width: 750px) 41vw, 82vw', widths: '400, 600, 800, 1000, 1200, 1600', alt: section.settings.image_alt
          -}}
        {%- else -%}
          <span class="ha-figure ha-figure--empty ha-reg-letter__img"><span class="ha-figure__label ha-record">01 / The envelope</span></span>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if left_url != blank -%}
          <a class="ha-reg-letter__words ha-reg-letter__words--left" href="{{ left_url }}">
        {%- else -%}
          <p class="ha-reg-letter__words ha-reg-letter__words--left">
        {%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.left_label != blank -%}
              <span class="ha-reg-letter__label ha-identify">{{ section.settings.left_label }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.left_word != blank -%}
              <span class="ha-reg-letter__word ha-narrate">{{ section.settings.left_word }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
        {%- if left_url != blank -%}</a>{%- else -%}</p>{%- endif -%}

        {%- if right_url != blank -%}
          <a class="ha-reg-letter__words ha-reg-letter__words--right" href="{{ right_url }}">
        {%- else -%}
          <p class="ha-reg-letter__words ha-reg-letter__words--right">
        {%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.right_label != blank -%}
              <span class="ha-reg-letter__label ha-identify">{{ section.settings.right_label }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if section.settings.right_word != blank -%}
              <span class="ha-reg-letter__word ha-narrate">{{ section.settings.right_word }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
        {%- if right_url != blank -%}</a>{%- else -%}</p>{%- endif -%}

        <h1 id="ha-reg-hero-title" class="{% if section.settings.show_title %}ha-reg-letter__title ha-narrate{% else %}visually-hidden{% endif %}">{{ section.settings.heading | default: page.title }}</h1>
      </div>

      {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
        <p class="ha-reg-letter__side ha-identify">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "HA — Register: Opening",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "ha-section-wrapper",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Band colour: Theme settings > Hartwick — Material Archive > Correspondence band. Grain: Theme settings > Grain on dark blocks > Page grain." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "paper", "label": "Paper photograph", "info": "Aloha's wine paper (24 September), laid under the whole band and the transparent menu. Empty = the Correspondence band colour." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "grain", "label": "Grain", "default": true },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Envelope photograph", "info": "Aloha's open envelope, cut out on a transparent ground. The words below sit on its sheets at fixed positions: a different photograph needs them re-measured." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "image_alt", "label": "Photograph alt text", "default": "An open mauve glassine envelope holding a grey card and a yellow card" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Page title", "default": "The Register", "info": "The page's h1." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_title", "label": "Show the title on the envelope's front", "default": false, "info": "Off: read by screen readers only, as in Aloha's 1 October design." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Side line", "default": "Hartwick Atelier / Correspondence", "info": "Runs up the envelope's right-hand side." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "The back sheet (left)" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "left_label", "label": "Label", "default": "The Circle" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "left_word", "label": "Word", "default": "By Invitation" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "left_link", "label": "Links to", "info": "Leave empty for plain words." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "The front sheet (right)" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "right_label", "label": "Label", "default": "The Dispatch" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "right_word", "label": "Word", "default": "Read" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "right_link", "label": "Links to", "info": "Leave empty for plain words." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Provisional content" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_placeholder_note", "label": "Show placeholder notice", "default": true }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "HA — Register: Opening" }]
}
{% endschema %}
